  "title": "用消元法解二元一次方程组",
  "stem": "解方程组：\n（1）\\(\\begin{cases} x+y=5 \\\\ x-y=-1 \\end{cases}\\)；\n（2）\\(\\begin{cases} 2x-y=5 \\\\ 3x+4y=2 \\end{cases}\\)．",
  "choices": [],
